# consumer compiles against. Every publish is waited for: lib/lib.b's own publish follows each
# lib edit, and app/main.b is published ONLY when app/main.b itself changes (FR-012: no fan-out).
#  1 open app/main.b -> clean              2 open lib/lib.b -> clean
#  3 lib: helper -> helper2 (unsaved)      4 app re-sent identical -> missing-member error
#  5 lib back, app re-sent -> clean
