#    AND in wrap's body; app re-sent -> clean. Sliced from the DISK text at the buffer's line, the
#    generic's "body" would be tail() (disk line 16), so lib.wrap would vanish and main.b would fail
#    AT lib.wrap; a clean publish shows the verbatim body came from the buffer (audit R1; T009 is R1's main lock).
